--- A list holding an int past 64 bits, handed where a tensor of numbers is
--- taken (math's `sum`, `max`, `mean`), is its numbers, that int its
--- nearest float, as `float[n]` reads it (spec, Element-wise). The
--- interpreter had stopped, "a list of int is not a list of numbers",
--- where the compiled program answered (Rosetta Code, CSV data
--- manipulation).
use math

big = []
big = push[big, 2 ^ 70]
big = push[big, 1]
log[sum[big]]
log[max[big]]
log[mean[big]]
log[sum[big] eq float[2 ^ 70]]
